# Allow-list build context: only what the image needs.
# Biometric samples (*.jpeg, test.jpg), data/, models/, credentials, tests and
# docs never enter the image. Models, data and credentials are mounted at runtime.
*
!app
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version

# Never ship caches, even from inside app/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
